Material Symbols Rounded by Google, licensed under Apache License 2.0.
Source: https://github.com/google/material-design-icons/tree/master/variablefont

MaterialSymbolsRounded-Prompt.ttf is a subset of the official variable TTF,
instanced at FILL=1, GRAD=0, opsz=24, and wght=700. It contains mic (U+E029),
fullscreen (U+E5D0), and fullscreen_exit (U+E5D1).
The license text is in MaterialSymbolsRounded-LICENSE.txt.
